# Copy to deploy/.env (gitignored) only to override something; nothing needs it. Both sites' AWS ids live in Terraform
# (infra/live, infra/next: terraform -chdir=infra/<dir> output) and the deploy reads them from the repository variables
# or deploy/.distribution-id and deploy/.next-distribution-id.
RELAY_DOMAIN=  # deploy/relay/deploy.sh: the relay's name (else mcp.overdubstudio.com)
# (ZONE, CERT and OAC were the old site's ids in AJ's personal account; nothing reads them now.)
